  "raw_response": "```python\ndef solve(grid):\n    rows = len(grid)\n    cols = len(grid[0])\n    \n    from collections import Counter\n    flat = [c for row in grid for c in row]\n    bg = Counter(flat).most_common(1)[0][0]\n    \n    # Find indicator 4 (on grid boundary)\n    indicator = None\n    for r in range(rows):\n        for c in range(cols):\n            if grid[r][c] == 4 and (r == 0 or r == rows-1 or c == 0 or c == cols-1):\n                indicator = (r, c)\n                break\n        if indicator:\n            break\n    \n    ir, ic = indicator\n    dr = 1 if ir == 0 else (-1 if ir == rows-1 else 0)\n    dc = 1 if ic == 0 else (-1 if ic == cols-1 else 0)\n    \n    result = [row[:] for row in grid]\n    \n    for r in range(rows):\n        for c in range(cols):\n            if grid[r][c] != bg:\n                continue\n            cr, cc = r - dr, c - dc\n            while 0 <= cr < rows and 0 <= cc < cols:\n                if grid[cr][cc] == 4:\n                    break\n                if grid[cr][cc] != bg:\n                    result[r][c] = 0\n                    break\n                cr -= dr\n                cc -= dc\n    \n    return result\n```",
  "script": "def solve(grid):\n    rows = len(grid)\n    cols = len(grid[0])\n    \n    from collections import Counter\n    flat = [c for row in grid for c in row]\n    bg = Counter(flat).most_common(1)[0][0]\n    \n    # Find indicator 4 (on grid boundary)\n    indicator = None\n    for r in range(rows):\n        for c in range(cols):\n            if grid[r][c] == 4 and (r == 0 or r == rows-1 or c == 0 or c == cols-1):\n                indicator = (r, c)\n                break\n        if indicator:\n            break\n    \n    ir, ic = indicator\n    dr = 1 if ir == 0 else (-1 if ir == rows-1 else 0)\n    dc = 1 if ic == 0 else (-1 if ic == cols-1 else 0)\n    \n    result = [row[:] for row in grid]\n    \n    for r in range(rows):\n        for c in range(cols):\n            if grid[r][c] != bg:\n                continue\n            cr, cc = r - dr, c - dc\n            while 0 <= cr < rows and 0 <= cc < cols:\n                if grid[cr][cc] == 4:\n                    break\n                if grid[cr][cc] != bg:\n                    result[r][c] = 0\n                    break\n                cr -= dr\n                cc -= dc\n    \n    return result",
